---
export const prerender = true;
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Inclusion at Aspire Sports"
  description="Aspire Sports inclusion principles — how we run programs that welcome every player, every family, every community."
>
  <main id="main-content" class="bg-cream">
    {/* Hero */}
    <section class="relative pt-24 pb-12 lg:pt-32 lg:pb-16">
      <div class="max-w-[1100px] mx-auto px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-16">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between py-6 border-b border-ink/15 mb-12">
          <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-ink-muted">
            Aspire Sports · Community
          </span>
          <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-ink-muted hidden sm:inline">
            Inclusion
          </span>
        </div>

        <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-primary-orange mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="inline-block w-8 h-px bg-primary-orange"></span>
          Our principles
        </p>

        <h1
          class="font-display text-ink leading-tight mb-8"
          style="font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 5.5rem); letter-spacing: -0.03em;"
        >
          Sports for <span class="italic text-primary-orange">everyone.</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-ink-2 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
          Aspire Sports is for the kid who's never touched a ball, the adult returning after
          twenty years away, and every player in between. These are the principles that govern
          how we run our programs.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    {/* Principles */}
    <section class="py-16 lg:py-24">
      <div class="max-w-[1100px] mx-auto px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-16 space-y-16">
        <div>
          <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-primary-orange mb-3">
            ① Skill, not status
          </p>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl lg:text-3xl text-ink mb-3">
            Programs sort by skill — never by who you know.
          </h2>
          <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed text-lg">
            Travel-team politics, "the right club," gym memberships passed down — none of it
            applies here. Our placement decisions use age, skill, and player preference. That's it.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-primary-orange mb-3">
            ② Beginners are welcome
          </p>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl lg:text-3xl text-ink mb-3">
            New to the sport? Start here.
          </h2>
          <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed text-lg">
            Most programs include a beginner pathway. Coaches lead with fundamentals. There's
            no test to pass before you can join — only a spot to claim.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-primary-orange mb-3">
            ③ Every player gets coached
          </p>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl lg:text-3xl text-ink mb-3">
            No bench-warmers as a strategy.
          </h2>
          <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed text-lg">
            Every registered player gets meaningful playing time at their level. We don't
            run programs where kids pay to watch from the sideline.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-primary-orange mb-3">
            ④ Cost shouldn't be the gate
          </p>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl lg:text-3xl text-ink mb-3">
            Talk to us if cost is a barrier.
          </h2>
          <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed text-lg">
            We offer payment plans, and we have limited-need scholarships. Email
            <a href="mailto:hello@aspiresportsohio.com" class="text-primary-orange hover:underline">
              hello@aspiresportsohio.com
            </a>{" "}
            and we'll work something out. No application essay, no public record.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-primary-orange mb-3">
            ⑤ Identity is not a debate
          </p>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl lg:text-3xl text-ink mb-3">
            Players choose how they're addressed and grouped.
          </h2>
          <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed text-lg">
            Every player — youth or adult — has the right to be addressed by their name, their
            pronouns, and to play in the league or division that fits them. Coaches are trained
            to respect these choices without commentary.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-primary-orange mb-3">
            ⑥ Accommodations on request
          </p>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl lg:text-3xl text-ink mb-3">
            Disability, neurodivergence, medical — we'll meet you where you are.
          </h2>
          <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed text-lg">
            Tell us in your registration notes or email separately. Our coaches adjust drills,
            pace, and team placement to fit. Programs that aren't appropriate get a clear "this
            isn't the right fit" rather than a sink-or-swim experience.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {/* Footer link */}
    <section class="bg-cream-2 py-12">
      <div class="max-w-[1100px] mx-auto px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-16 text-center">
        <p class="text-ink-muted">
          See also: <a href="/community/sportsmanship" class="text-primary-orange hover:underline">Sportsmanship</a>{" "}
          · <a href="/promise" class="text-primary-orange hover:underline">The Aspire Promise</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
